---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Trust & security" description="Plain-language data handling, approvals, retention, and incident response for Kora Desk.">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Trust"
    title="You approve money. We keep the trail."
    lede="Written for owners, family partners, and the skeptic at the table."
  />
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      WhatsApp messages needed to take orders and match payments, your price list, and the name and number you give us at sign-up. We do not scrape your personal family chats. You choose which number is connected.
    </p>
    <h2>Where data is stored</h2>
    <p>
      For Nigerian shops, message content and ledgers are stored in West Africa (Lagos region) with a backup in a second African region. We do not sell customer lists.
    </p>
    <h2>Who can see it</h2>
    <p>
      Your staff, with roles you assign. Your accountant, if you invite them. Kora Desk support, only when you ask, and that access is logged. Agents act inside those same permissions.
    </p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      Operational chats: 18 months unless you ask for longer for tax. Backups: 30 days. You can export and delete. NDPA and similar rules in Kenya, Ghana, and South Africa are reviewed before we expand.
    </p>
    <h2>Approval controls</h2>
    <p>
      The agent never moves money without you. Refunds, write-offs, and orders above your limit wait. Most actions can be reversed for 24 hours.
    </p>
    <h2>If something goes wrong</h2>
    <p>
      We will tell affected customers without hiding behind jargon, log the incident, and work with regulators where required. Support has a named person for every pilot shop.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a class="link-accent" href="/legal/privacy">Privacy notice</a> ·
      <a class="link-accent" href="/kora-desk-security-one-pager.txt" download>Download one-page summary</a>
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">This page summarizes how we work. It is not legal advice.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
